---

<Layout
  title="Cordeiro Energia - Energia Solar em Minas Gerais | Orçamento Grátis"
  description="Especialistas em energia solar fotovoltaica em Curvelo/MG. Reduza sua conta de luz em até 95% com sistema solar profissional. Orçamento gratuito."
>
  <Header />

  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg">
        <img src="/hero-solar.jpg" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="container hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <svg style="width:1rem;height:1rem;" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><path d="M12 1v3M12 20v3M4.22 4.22l2.12 2.12M17.66 17.66l2.12 2.12M1 12h3M20 12h3M4.22 19.78l2.12-2.12M17.66 6.34l2.12-2.12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          Energia Solar Fotovoltaica
        </div>
        <h1>Deixe o sol <span>pagar sua conta</span></h1>
        <p>Reduza sua conta de luz em até <strong>95%</strong> com um sistema solar profissional. Sem burocracia, com garantia de 25 anos.</p>
        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-orange btn-xl">QUERO ECONOMIZAR
            <svg style="width:1rem;height:1rem;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/5538997350343?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20gostaria%20de%20um%20or%C3%A7amento%20para%20energia%20solar" class="btn btn-outline btn-xl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg style="width:1.1rem;height:1.1rem;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
